{"id":"958ef9477c2fa52f","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-lindenbaum-countable.md","title":"Countable Lindenbaum","display":"Countable Lindenbaum","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-lindenbaum-countable","aliases":["93-fact-lindenbaum-countable"],"display":"Countable Lindenbaum","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-countable-language]]","[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","[[93-df-logic-algebra]]","[[93-prop-lindenbaum-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-lindenbaum-countable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-lindenbaum-countable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Countable Lindenbaum"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6402ac591e410d0b\" href=\"?note=6402ac591e410d0b\" title=\"93-df-countable-language\">93-df-countable-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"00b872b34c5e977d\" href=\"?note=00b872b34c5e977d\" title=\"93-df-logic-algebra\">93-df-logic-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cc0e90fd941e3f0c\" href=\"?note=cc0e90fd941e3f0c\" title=\"93-prop-lindenbaum-algebra\">93-prop-lindenbaum-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"fact-lindenbaum-countable-—-Countable-Lindenbaum\">fact-lindenbaum-countable — Countable Lindenbaum</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> is a language, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{\\mathcal L}=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(F_{\\mathcal L}=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> is a logic on that carrier.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\">\\(\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LindAlg}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\">\\(\\operatorname{LindAlg}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\)</span> are the sourced interderivability relation and Lindenbaum algebra.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}\\)</span> are the sourced language, typed-logic, and countability predicates.</li>\n<li>Interderivability is assumed to be a congruence of the formula algebra; this supplies the required equivalence relation and the canonical quotient carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}lindenbaum\\text{-}countable}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land F_{\\mathcal L}=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(F_{\\mathcal L},\\vdash)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}(F_{\\mathcal L})\\notag\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L})\n\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}\\Bigl(\n\\bigl|\\operatorname{LindAlg}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\bigr|\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}lindenbaum\\text{-}countable}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land F_{\\mathcal L}=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(F_{\\mathcal L},\\vdash)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}(F_{\\mathcal L})\\notag\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L})\n\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}\\Bigl(\n\\bigl|\\operatorname{LindAlg}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\bigr|\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The carrier of the sourced Lindenbaum algebra is the quotient of\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(F_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> by interderivability.  Its canonical quotient map is\nsurjective, so a countable formula carrier has an at-most-countable\nLindenbaum carrier.  The congruence premise prevents quotient notation\nfrom being applied to a relation whose algebraic compatibility was only\nasserted in prose.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"fact-lindenbaum-countable-—-Countable-Lindenbaum","text":"fact-lindenbaum-countable — Countable Lindenbaum","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-countable-language","status":"resolved","id":"6402ac591e410d0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-countable-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-logic-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"00b872b34c5e977d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-prop-lindenbaum-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"cc0e90fd941e3f0c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-prop-lindenbaum-algebra]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"F_{\\mathcal L}=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LindAlg}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}lindenbaum\\text{-}countable}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land F_{\\mathcal L}=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(F_{\\mathcal L},\\vdash)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}(F_{\\mathcal L})\\notag\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L})\n\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}\\Bigl(\n\\bigl|\\operatorname{LindAlg}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\bigr|\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F_{\\mathcal L}","display":false}],"bytes":1988,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["6402ac591e410d0b","e30eac382dc7d1a7","00b872b34c5e977d","cc0e90fd941e3f0c"]}